#: 
msgid "Sorry we're not able to retrieve your Patron level because no network is available!"
msgstr "Leider können wir deinen Patreon-Level nicht abrufen, da kein Netzwerk verfügbar ist!"

#: 
msgid "We're not able to retrieve your Patron level! Sorry for the inconvenience, we're already working on a fix!"
